# Fog prevents combat damage, but the Avian attacked and therefore loses a counter at end of combat (CR 603.4).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Clockwork Avian
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Fog
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clockwork Avian.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Clockwork Avian > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Fog.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Clockwork Avian.Counters.Plus1Plus0 = 3
